  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nPrincipal (P) = 100000\n\nAmount (A) = 146410\n\nRate (r) = 10%\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nA = P(1+(r)/(100))^t \n\n**Calculations:**\n\n146410 = 100000(1+(10)/(100))^t \n\n⇒ 1.4641 = 1.1t\n\n⇒ 1.1⁴ = 1.4641\n\n**∴ t = 4 years.**",
